g on their relationships and starting families, pole-dance instructor Roos resolutely remains single: love has disappointed her too many times to ever give another man the chance of capturing her heart. Until she sees a note posted on the information board in her local supermarket, written by someone who has apparently spotted her in the park.","duration":34,"scws_id":397225,"season_id":10865,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:12.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-02 18:22:42","images":[{"id":311352,"filename":"832cf1fb-cc8b-4130-b995-447f6d92899e.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":137413,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:22:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T16:22:43.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/832cf1fb-cc8b-4130-b995-447f6d92899e.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":396641,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":137413,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 1"}]},{"id":137417,"number":2,"name":"Episodio 2","plot":"Katja and Simon have found each other in their sharp observations and in their remorseless sense of humor. Not much of that razor-sharp edge survived after Simon was left both partially paralyzed and suffering from aphasia. Then Simon risks it all by proposing this: if he is unable to provide Katja with the intimacy that she needs, then perhaps she should look for it in someone else.","duration":39,"scws_id":397226,"season_id":10865,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:34.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:12.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-02 18:24:34","images":[{"id":311356,"filename":"68ee0cae-7eee-4200-ae97-5975233b1be3.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":137417,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:35.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/68ee0cae-7eee-4200-ae97-5975233b1be3.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":396646,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":137417,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 2"}]},{"id":137418,"number":3,"name":"Episodio 3","plot":"Benjamin comes home to celebrate Christmas with his father Chris and his two older brothers, Alex and Marius. It’s their first Christmas without their mother Lies, who passed away after a prolonged illness in the spring. At Christmas dinner, Benjamin wants to uphold one of his mother’s traditions, which is to ask each other ‘The Big Questions’. This meets serious resistance from his brothers.","duration":31,"scws_id":397227,"season_id":10865,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:12.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-02 18:24:37","images":[{"id":311357,"filename":"d855c426-914d-4db9-8582-d6c4409179f8.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":137418,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:37.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/d855c426-914d-4db9-8582-d6c4409179f8.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":396647,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":137418,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 3"}]},{"id":137419,"number":4,"name":"Episodio 4","plot":"Dwayne and Marisa are happy with their two little girls. Still, Dwayne finds it difficult to allow himself to fully commit himself emotionally to his present family situation. Years before, he had lost his previous wife and his two young sons when hurricane Irma hit St Maarten during their stay there.","duration":24,"scws_id":397228,"season_id":10865,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:12.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-02 18:24:39","images":[{"id":311358,"filename":"d998001c-4d0e-4664-8fb8-78d211ea9edc.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":137419,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:39.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/d998001c-4d0e-4664-8fb8-78d211ea9edc.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":396648,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":137419,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 4"}]},{"id":137416,"number":5,"name":"Episodio 5","plot":"Colette and her partner Naomi want to have children and are very happy when their good friend Boaz is willing to donate sperm for this purpose. Naomi is totally prepared for this next step in her life and can’t wait to get pregnant. Colette, a promising young author, is struggling with her own issues and with her next novel. It might be that Naomi’s plans are a little premature for her.","duration":34,"scws_id":397229,"season_id":10865,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:09.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:42:12.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2025-10-02 18:24:09","images":[{"id":311355,"filename":"6d7c5ef4-2855-47d8-a590-e90db530d51e.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":137416,"created_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T16:24:10.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/6d7c5ef4-2855-47d8-a590-e90db530d51e.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":396645,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":137416,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 5"}]},{"id":137420,"number":6,"name":"Episodio 6","plot":"Guus and Lil have everything their hearts desire. And not just each other because Guus and Lil have agreed that they are free to date other people if they want to. It’s not always easy, but as long as they make sure their extramarital affairs stay extra